{"lines":[{"t":"Introduction","h":0.014534882851794828,"x":0.80968858100987218,"y":0.055232558428753742,"w":0.10380622863769529,"c":1},{"x":0.19366202962185505,"y":0.098507397889323278,"h":0.020803319398467579,"c":1,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","w":0.50021006266276036},{"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading answer key you will find a chart which will help","x":0.19192972886873311,"h":0.021320509860530579,"w":0.69744598388671886,"c":1,"y":0.1389931205072612},{"x":0.19196199383887555,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your practice test results, you are ready to take the","y":0.15717226747445356,"w":0.68182189941406246,"c":1,"h":0.021106523763391061},{"h":0.014069068673776441,"w":0.088896083831787126,"t":"IELTS test.","x":0.19001203427709071,"c":1,"y":0.17695926767339765},{"x":0.20927547834903615,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","y":0.19468642966726069,"w":0.67659617106119796,"h":0.019670143421084973,"c":1},{"x":0.19194007377316799,"h":0.021748540783529058,"c":1,"y":0.2122468811570174,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","w":0.70782780965169267},{"x":0.1919012031137918,"c":1,"y":0.23019370691297036,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which","h":0.021617801311217932,"w":0.67325907389322914},{"y":0.24844849150417381,"t":"is the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering","w":0.68536626180013016,"h":0.021956366371491121,"c":1,"x":0.19019457782300417},{"c":1,"w":0.69204152425130228,"x":0.19031141754562925,"t":"your application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Band Score","y":0.26889534890726896,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"c":1,"y":0.28622428557825752,"t":"for each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed","w":0.69395456949869783,"h":0.021139418519903086,"x":0.19020924424695948},{"t":"for a particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and","x":0.1902067003960167,"y":0.30432016310036936,"h":0.021422501624756674,"w":0.69394760131835931,"c":1},{"w":0.71639038085937501,"t":"writing, but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening","h":0.02038236995774434,"c":1,"x":0.19025622582089832,"y":0.32266966752314796},{"y":0.33884885963624622,"h":0.026346485626455696,"w":0.70963287353515625,"c":1,"t":"might be acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots","x":0.19017150073017017},{"t":"of lectures and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even","w":0.69913213094075521,"y":0.35885798524729839,"x":0.19023259580689283,"h":0.021571336216322567,"c":1},{"y":0.37928621406894791,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565315,"x":0.19031141630863005,"t":"though the Overall Band Score was 7.","w":0.29930796305338536},{"y":0.39563520176031819,"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening","x":0.21092778434323123,"w":0.68712631225585941,"h":0.022823288358951199,"c":1},{"h":0.020862065469409496,"c":1,"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","y":0.41449015177053083,"x":0.19022947870706711,"w":0.70085856119791667},{"w":0.68339101155598958,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are","h":0.018918742826553814,"c":1,"x":0.19031141454999501,"y":0.43456962923144249},{"h":0.016124668615193016,"w":0.17993080139160156,"x":0.18858131194761574,"c":1,"t":"ready to take the test.","y":0.45203488377749435},{"t":"The practice tests have been checked to ensure that they are the same level of difficulty","x":0.20752954813159116,"h":0.0203094482421875,"c":1,"y":0.46957089542058505,"w":0.69221572875976556},{"w":0.70088490804036452,"h":0.02172323337712434,"t":"as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the practice tests","y":0.48815630838533386,"c":1,"x":0.18848694829312157},{"t":"will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The practice tests can only give you an idea of your","h":0.023539098014858206,"w":0.70614634195963544,"x":0.1884559666510745,"c":1,"y":0.50440618605943421},{"h":0.020069022208681564,"c":1,"y":0.52498104433381843,"x":0.18851608106578605,"t":"possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions based on","w":0.67489776611328134},{"w":0.089965394337972016,"c":1,"x":0.19031142001671181,"y":0.54651162819430688,"t":"your score.","h":0.011627906014487155},{"y":0.56133079462225011,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We","x":0.20751183602572876,"w":0.65763376871744794,"h":0.020819604605373798,"c":1},{"x":0.188471722244475,"w":0.70608800252278625,"h":0.020988209419437354,"c":1,"t":"have based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions","y":0.5798920755365361},{"t":"accept. The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower","x":0.18849573965682803,"y":0.5983968803256432,"h":0.022022288024133529,"c":1,"w":0.70777887980143217},{"t":"score than most other institutions.","y":0.61616222267005383,"w":0.27365287780761716,"x":0.18673810337503843,"h":0.017646788216037601,"c":1},{"h":0.014534882851794828,"t":"9","x":0.89100346058034496,"y":0.95494186071799791,"c":1,"w":0.013840829531351795}],"h":2857,"w":2400}